{"title": "[花邊] FINCH:想讓Kuminga成為Anunoby那種球員", "author": "iammatrix (母體)", "board": "", "date": "Tue Sep 15 14:26:06 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1789453570.A.7CB.html", "body": "來源:minnpost\n\nhttps://www.minnpost.com/sports/timberwolves/2026/09/\n\nthe-chris-finch-interview-part-3-how-does-kuminga-find-his-ceiling/\n\n灰狼教練在接受MINNPOST訪問，關於Kuminga的腳色定位問題\n\nMP: An OG Anunoby type.\n\nFinch: Yeah, absolutely. Like, why not? And as he continues to mature and\ndevelop and all these things, he’ll become a better shooter. Can we get him\nto lean a little bit more toward efficiency? Not with such drastic (demands)\nas, “You’ve got to get to the rim or shoot a three.” You need to give a\nplayer some license to be who they are. Besides, we’ve seen it from him in\nthe playoffs — if he has a matchup he feels like he can take, he can take\nit. He can make shots. He’s actually played better in the playoffs and has\nhad maybe more inconsistency in regular season basketball. That gives you\ngreat hope of what he can do.\n\nWe’re not opposed to isolation basketball — you know that because we’ve\nplayed it with a bunch of other dudes. But setting up those isolations,\nwhether it be through the flow or by design, I think could help, because it\nmight give him the green light in the context of what we’re doing.\n\nAnd let’s face it, with respect to where he has been before, it is hard to\ncome into something as a rookie like what was happening in Golden State. I\nmean, expectations were high and it was an extremely unique brand of\nbasketball.\n\n-------------------------------\n\nMP： 一種 OG Anunoby 類型的球員。\n\nFinch： 是的，當然。為什麼不呢？\n\n隨著他不斷成熟、成長，加上這些發展，他會成為更好的射手。\n\n我們能不能讓他稍微更傾向效率？不是那種極端要求，\n\n比如「你必須殺到籃下或投三分」。\n\n你得給球員一些空間，讓他做自己。況且我們在季後賽已經看到過——\n如果他遇到自己覺得能打的對位，他就能去打。\n\n他能投進球。他其實在季後賽打得更好，常規賽反而可能更不穩定。\n\n這讓人對他能做到什麼充滿希望。\n\n我們並不反對單打——你也知道，因為我們和其他很多球員都這麼打過。\n\n但把這些單打設置出來，無論是通過比賽流動還是特意設計，我認為會有幫助，\n\n因為這可能在我們的體系裡給他開綠燈。\n\n而且說實話，考慮到他之前的處境，作為新秀進入金州當時那種環境是很難的。\n期望很高，而且那是一種極其獨特的籃球風格。\n\n-----------------------------\n\n這不就是當初在勇士科學家要你做的腳色，\n\n\"做好防守側翼，少持球單打，多跑動來製造空切與上籃機會，\n\n投籃中距離跟三分練準一點，關鍵時刻能提供穩定命中。\"\n\n這樣不就是穩穩的三千五百萬了嗎?\n\n結果繞了一大圈，最後 灰狼還是要你當OG。\n\n想當OG也不是那麼容易的。\n\nOG的罰球一開始也是水準以下，現在人家已經是後衛的八成準度了。\n\n三分準度出手、投籃命中都是聯盟中上水準，更別說防守態度。\n\n他那經紀人是看到兩人表面數據沒差很多，就覺得一樣能領那麼多嗎?\n\n去把進階數據 ON/OFF一攤開，馬上就露餡。", "comments": [{"tag": "→", "user": "bm1041644", "content": "「讓他做自己」", "time": "09/15 14:28"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "tailsean", "content": "三分...", "time": "09/15 14:28"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "JarvanII", "content": "不就是現代Marion嗎", "time": "09/15 14:30"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "supereva", "content": "OG超強的好不好", "time": "09/15 14:30"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "limitlesscit", "content": "他想要當可愛拉~ 不然當初AG也是很強阿", "time": "09/15 14:31"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "atpx", "content": "苦命這咖的問題就是態度", "time": "09/15 14:31"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "iammatrix", "content": "og我覺得是鋒線型Klay", "time": "09/15 14:32"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "iammatrix", "content": "爆發力更強 防守大鎖", "time": "09/15 14:32"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "goury", "content": "很強，但不是全明星", "time": "09/15 14:34"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "hyperfrog", "content": "技能組差有點多", "time": "09/15 14:34"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "yunyue", "content": "OG很認份喔", "time": "09/15 14:34"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "DaiFu", "content": "Not even close", "time": "09/15 14:34"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ayubabbit", "content": "可愛這麼認真防守 我都覺得他只想坦克切", "time": "09/15 14:35"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "paracase", "content": "話說,應該是角色吧?有腳色這種用法嗎？", "time": "09/15 14:35"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "hyperfrog", "content": "主要是苦命那個撞牆切也很低效", "time": "09/15 14:36"}, {"tag": "噓", "user": "bm1041644", "content": "但OG斷過腿 苦命沒有 心態差多了", "time": "09/15 14:36"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "xo45527788", "content": "讓他當Randle", "time": "09/15 14:36"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "harry0702000", "content": "苦命的投射應該是長不出來了，一直都有一場沒一場", "time": "09/15 14:36"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "harry0702000", "content": "的", "time": "09/15 14:36"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ClownT", "content": "車神：OG現在是宇宙最強了 這你吃得消啊", "tim